## 5. Retired phrases

文件：`pass/.review-retired-phrases.txt`，一行一个具体短语。

扫描范围：

- `index.yaml`
- `architecture/`
- `modules/`
- `flows/`
- `troubleshooting/`
- 排除 `pass/`、`works/`

命令（无 Python）：

```bash
grep -RF -f .think-tank/knowledge-base/pass/.review-retired-phrases.txt \
  .think-tank/knowledge-base/index.yaml \
  .think-tank/knowledge-base/architecture \
  .think-tank/knowledge-base/modules \
  .think-tank/knowledge-base/flows \
  .think-tank/knowledge-base/troubleshooting
```

命中是**候选**，不是自动失败。目标文档 reviewer 判断是否同一事实：

- 是 → 修，进入下一轮；
- 否 → 记入 accepted contexts，后续跳过该文件+章节。

### Accepted contexts

| phrase | file | section | reason |
|--------|------|---------|--------|
| | | | |

